rd encompasses all things in knowledge; then will you not remember?","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":80,"sd":null},{"k":"6:81","t":"And how should I fear what you associate while you do not fear that you have associated with Allāh that for which He has not sent down to you any authority? So which of the two parties has more right to security, if you should know?\"","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":81,"sd":null}],"juz":7,"hizb":14,"surahs":[6],"sajdah":false}